{"unit_id":"sandbaseai__sandbase-skills#card-zh","repo":"sandbaseai/sandbase-skills","commit":"cbab58188611e626ccaf54ac346b437d12ea4729","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"SandBase Agent Skills 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 等 Agent 客户端的可安装技能集合，覆盖研究、社交情报、营销、软件工程、数据科学和业务工作流。DSH bundle 将 marketing/ 与 research/ 加入技能文件系统；命令行安装器可列出、添加或移除项目级技能。代表工作流包括多源搜索与证据账本、SEO 关键词机会分析，以及可复用的本地数据可视化流程。适合希望为 Agent 增加明确步骤和输出规范的研究者与开发团队。基础技能可使用宿主已有能力；需要专业数据源的工作流可选接 SandBase MCP。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/cordis.patch.yml:6-13","lib/dsh-installer.mjs:8-71","research/multi-source-search/SKILL.md:7-12","research/multi-source-search/SKILL.md:84-102","marketing/seo-keyword-insights/SKILL.md:8-10","marketing/data-visualization/SKILL.md:6-18"]}
